---
title: "Identity - who is this sender?"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Enrollment
    lg1: Directory
    lg2: Session
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 teal
  s0: Not enrolled
  s1: Key enrolled
  s2: Alias claimed
  s3: Live session
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the peer's key is enrolled or your key is enrolled
  s1 --> s2: the peer claims the alias first or you claim the alias
  s2 --> s1: the alias claim is released
  s2 --> s3: the peer's client binds the alias or your client binds the alias
  s3 --> s2: the client session ends (the claim remains)
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 orange
  class s3 teal
